  "Months afterwards, when a customer queried an invoice, there was no record of why the price was what it was. The figures had been written on a sheet of paper, and the sheet of paper was gone.": "Meses después, cuando un cliente consultó un Factura, no quedó constancia de por qué el precio era el que era.",
